	\L_07d34:
	ZH 1:
	'Well...'
	\L_07e59:
	\L_07e4c:
	\L_07da4:
	ZH 1:
	'What is it?'
	\L_07e59:
	\L_07e4c:
	\L_07d34:
	ZH 1:
	'Lady was the leader of a group'
