	\L_07da4:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_07e59:
	ZH 1:
	'All prostitutes in the Lady'
	R
	'Caravan were in a position'
	R
	'where being there was'
	R
	'preferable.'
	\L_07e59:
	ZH 1:
